== Trivia ==
* [[anti:It Hurts|It Hurts]] originates from the ''Antibirth'' mod, and by extension, from the ''Community Remix'' mod for the flash version.
** In ''Community Remix'', it was a simple stat up and damage multiplier item which multiplied damage by 1.3, added 1.0 damage, and added 0.3 speed.<ref>https://web.archive.org/web/20221115035837/http://platinumgod.co.uk/old/index.html</ref>
* The splash text "No it doesn't..." could reference the fact that Isaac has a sewn shut mouth, making him unable to say that it does.

